    "Jika ukuran sistem dikali N, biaya formal naik N k . Marker bergerak memperlihatkan biaya relatif tiap metode.":"As system size increases, the formal computational cost scales as N to the power k. The moving marker compares the relative cost of each method.",
    "Korelasi lewat fungsional":"Correlation through the functional",
