    "Basis lebih besar = ruang fungsi lebih lengkap = energi lebih rendah (variasional) tetapi lebih mahal. Gaussian dipakai karena integral dua-elektronnya analitik; beberapa Gaussian \"dikontraksi\" meniru Slater.":"A larger basis provides a more complete function space and generally lowers the variational energy, but it is more expensive. Gaussian functions are widely used because two-electron integrals can be evaluated analytically; contracted Gaussian functions mimic Slater-type orbitals.",
    "6.2 Polarisasi dan fungsi difus":"6.2 Polarization and diffuse functions",
