    "D2.1 Tangga Jacob":"D2.1 Jacob's ladder","D2.2 Apa arti GGA? Faktor peningkatan pertukaran":"D2.2 What does GGA mean? Exchange enhancement factor",
    "D2.3 Dispersi: mengapa DFT perlu koreksi":"D2.3 Dispersion: why DFT needs a correction",
